    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEw">II Ew</ref> 1.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">He agsode hy þa, hwa to ðære bote cyrran wolde ⁊ on ðære geferræddenne beon ðe he wære, ⁊ þæt lufian ðæt he lufode, ⁊ ðæt ascunian ðæt he ascunode, ægðer ge on sæ ge on lande.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">He asked which of them would devote themselves to this [work of] reformation and which of them would cooperate with him in his efforts, favouring what he favoured and discountenancing what he discountenanced, both by land and sea.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">He agsode hy ða, hwa to ðære bote cyrran wolde ⁊ on ðære geferrædene beon ðe he wære, ⁊ þæt lufian þæt he lufode, ⁊ þæt ascunian þæt he ascunode, ægðær ge on sæ ge on lande.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
